{"id":"k6nu8jhh3pqsfx37ve0nk25wd","title":"Ruby 中的 nothing_provided 技巧","originalTitle":"Moment of Ruby: An Argument for Nothing","summary":"作者发现了一个在 Ruby 中区分是否提供参数值的小技巧。通过将默认参数表达式设置为一个赋值操作，当参数省略时，表达式会被评估并作为默认值使用；若提供任何参数，即使为 false 或 nil，表达式将不会被评估，从而实现区分不同情况的目的。这一技巧最初由 Addendum byroot 在 Rails PR #44611 中提出。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://www.aha.io/engineering/articles/moment-of-ruby-an-argument-for-nothing"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-02T20:32:57.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-05T11:46:57.374Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-02T20:32:57.000Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["教程与观点","GitHub"],"score":41,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}